#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_stabilize.rst:43
msgid "This effect/filter stabilizes 360 footage."
msgstr "Questo effetto/filtro stabilizza un filmato a 360°."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_stabilize.rst:45
msgid ""
"The filter works in two phases: analysis and stabilization. When analyzing "
"footage, it detects frame-to-frame rotation, and when stabilizing it tries "
"to correct high-frequency motion (shake)."
msgstr ""
"Il filtro funziona in due fasi: analisi e stabilizzazione. Durante l'analisi "
"del filmato rileva la rotazione tra fotogramma a fotogramma, mentre durante "
"la stabilizzazione cerca di correggere il movimento ad alta frequenza "
"(tremolio)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_stabilize.rst:49
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_stabilize.rst:56
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parametro"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_stabilize.rst:57
msgid "Value"
